---
interface Props {
  homeHref?: string;
  sectionPrefix?: string;
}

const { homeHref = "/", sectionPrefix = "/" } = Astro.props;
const hrefFor = (id: string) => `${sectionPrefix}#${id}`;
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand-column">
        <a class="footer-brand" href={homeHref} aria-label="4steps Book Club 홈">
          <img class="footer-logo" src="/images/logo/logotype-dark.svg" alt="" width="351" height="150" />
          <span class="footer-method">READ · THINK · SPEAK · WRITE</span>
        </a>
        <p class="footer-audience">국제학교·해외 유학생을 위한 프리미엄 주니어 Reading &amp; Writing Club</p>
        <p class="footer-tagline">읽은 책이, 아이의 문장이 되도록.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-nav-column">
        <span class="footer-section-label">4STEPS 둘러보기</span>
        <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="푸터 메뉴"><a href={hrefFor("about")}>4steps의 차이</a><a href={hrefFor("method")}>4steps 방식</a><a href={hrefFor("class-content")}>수업 자료</a><a href={hrefFor("faculty")}>강사진</a><a href={hrefFor("level")}>레벨 안내</a><a href={hrefFor("management")}>학습 관리</a><a href={hrefFor("faq")}>FAQ</a><a href={hrefFor("notices")}>공지사항</a><a href={hrefFor("consulting")}>무료 레벨테스트</a></nav>
        <div class="footer-social-block">
          <span class="footer-section-label">소셜 채널</span>
          <div class="footer-socials">
            <a class="social-chip" href="https://m.blog.naver.com/4stepsbookclub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img class="brand-icon" src="/images/social/naver-blog.png" width="20" height="20" alt="" /> 네이버 블로그</a>
            <a class="social-chip" href="https://pf.kakao.com/_UxlvxnX" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img class="brand-icon" src="/images/social/kakao-channel.png" width="20" height="20" alt="" /> 카카오톡</a>
            <a class="social-chip" href="https://www.instagram.com/4stepsbookclub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img class="brand-icon" src="/images/social/instagram.webp" width="20" height="20" alt="" /> Instagram</a>
            <a class="social-chip threads-chip" href="https://www.threads.com/@4stepsbookclub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img class="brand-icon" src="/images/social/threads.png" width="20" height="20" alt="" /> Threads</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="business-info">
      <span class="footer-section-label">연락처 및 사업자 정보</span>
      <div class="business-details">
        <p><span class="business-item"><strong>상호</strong> 4스텝스북클럽온라인원격학원</span><span class="business-item"><strong>사업자등록번호</strong> 610-93-10022</span><span class="business-item"><strong>대표자</strong> 박소연</span></p>
        <p><span class="business-item"><strong>E-mail</strong> <a href="mailto:4stepsbookclub@gmail.com">4stepsbookclub@gmail.com</a></span><span class="business-item"><strong>Phone</strong> <a href="tel:01088354913">010-8835-4913</a></span></p>
        <p><span class="business-item">서울특별시 강남구 영동대로 602, 6층 Z175호 (삼성동)</span></p>
        <p><span class="business-item"><strong>학원설립·운영등록번호</strong> 제15451호</span><span class="business-item">4스텝스북클럽원격학원(4stepsbookclub)</span><span class="business-item"><strong>신고기관명</strong> 서울특별시 강남서초교육지원청</span></p>
      </div>
      <p class="copyright">© 2026 4STEPS BOOK CLUB. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
